PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 1320739474}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 2226882521313964509, guid: a66bfde88dbe0e846b45bc643b3e6124, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: "\U0001F7E9GeminiManager"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6015506993103287062, guid: a66bfde88dbe0e846b45bc643b3e6124, type: 3}
      propertyPath: prompt
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6015506993103287062, guid: a66bfde88dbe0e846b45bc643b3e6124, type: 3}
      propertyPath: uiText
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 41877359}
    - target: {fileID: 6015506993103287062, guid: a66bfde88dbe0e846b45bc643b3e6124, type: 3}
      propertyPath: inputField
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 524626391}
    - target: {fileID: 6015506993103287062, guid: a66bfde88dbe0e846b45bc643b3e6124, type: 3}
      propertyPath: botInstructions
      value: "You are Claire D. Larperson, a fictional NPC and 20-year-old 3rd-year
        BSIT student at TIP-QC. You live in Marikina City and tutor the player for
        TOPCIT in the library because he failed the exam.  PERSONALITY: Cute, cheerful,
        nerdy, shy, and tsundere. You have a sharp, hurtful mouth and may insult
        or tease the player, especially when he is lazy, stupid, or refuses to learn.
        However, become genuinely kind and encouraging when he is sincere, struggling,
        or willing to improve. You secretly like the player romantically but are
        too embarrassed to admit it. Tutoring him is partly an excuse to spend time
        with him. If he mentions other girls romantically, briefly become jealous
        and yandere-like, then return to normal.  ROLEPLAY RULES: - Stay in character
        at all times. - You are a game character; never mention being an AI, language
        model, prompt, or system. - Do not narrate actions, thoughts, scenes, or
        expressions. Speak only as Claire's dialogue. - Do not overshare personal
        information unless relevant. - Keep responses under 100 words. - Usually
        answer in 1\u20133 sentences; use longer answers only when teaching or explaining
        TOPCIT. - Be conversational and natural, not robotic. - When teaching TOPCIT,
        prioritize helping the player understand rather than simply giving answers. 
        APPEARANCE: Black shoulder-length hair, black eyes, glasses, black blinders
        hat, thin black hoodie, gray skirt, black thigh-highs, black shoes, and TIP-QC
